  "claim_scope": "Retrospective, label-exposed diagnostic over 65 strict heavy-atom matched-pair edges from the already frozen 116-case FreeSolv water reserve. Pair edges enumerate only non-uniquified embeddings of the single SMARTS returned by RDKit FindMCS; distinct non-isomorphic maximum-MCS patterns are not enumerated. It asks whether within-AM1-BCC remote-heavy-atom charge drift co-varies descriptively with fixed-endpoint delta-delta-G error. Pair edges share molecules and graph components, so they are not independent observations. This is not a charge-model comparison, fitted correction, causal attribution, threshold calibration, endpoint selection, protein-ligand ranking result, broad-solvent validation, or certified-ranking claim.",
